      "text": "Chiral Perturbation Theory: Expansions in the Mass of the Strange Quark — 43 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Gasser, H. Leutwvler / Chiral pert\n\n**Chiral Perturbation Theory: Expansions in the Mass of the Strange Quark**\n\n*North-Holland Publishing Company*\n\n52 pp, 43 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; J Gasser, H. Leutwvler / Chiral perturbation t; 3 Effective low-energy lagrangian; 4 Ground state; J Gasser, H. Leut~Tler / Chiral perturbation t; 5 Low-energy expansion at leading order; 6 Effective lagrangian to order p4; Z = Z, +ZA+Z,+Zoo~,,,op; D(fl )f( v' a' s' p' O) = I dx [tr { i[fl' a~'; J Gasser, H. Leutwyler / ('hiral perturbation ; Nc I; 483 and D stands for the differential operator; C V UV.U V~O>-aS(V' ~'-+U V.CV- ~-+U V.O>-; _N(F~_IF~,.L~j+); 8 Tadpoles and unitarity corrections; M~ln(MZp/pf)-M~ln(M~/p. 2) M~- MZo; 9 Vacuum expectation values",
